parameters.content:
# Non-negotiable security boundary

n8n receives a Real Estate AI Agent server-to-server event. It must never receive unauthenticated raw Meta webhook traffic directly.

Every internal Real Estate AI Agent endpoint must:
1. validate x-internal-secret;
2. resolve the organization from server-side records, not from the request alone;
3. verify conversation/contact/property IDs belong to that organization;
4. use durable event/message idempotency;
5. write tenant-scoped agent activity logs;
6. never return database/API credentials to n8n.

The workflow sends only explicit DTOs. It never forwards its `config` object to Real Estate AI Agent, so OpenAI keys and internal secrets are not written to CRM logs.

The Real Estate AI Agent send endpoint must enforce the WhatsApp service-window/template rules and create an idempotent outbound CRM message before calling Meta.

